ben (support): Customer checklist to add: 1) If 429s spike after deploy reduce max_response_tokens and trim history; 2) Enforce client-side concurrency limits; 3) Try a lighter/quantized model as fallback; 4) For Dedicated customers, scale pool; 5) Collect request ids + timestamps for support.

ana (docs): Migration note: older SDK helpers pre-v1.3 used message-count heuristics (trim_history). Newer SDKs expose trim_by_tokens() — prefer token-accurate trimming to avoid accidental context overflows.

